# Rules

## Iconography
- Always use Font Awesome icons (`<i class="fa-solid fa-..." ></i>`, `<i class="fa-regular fa-..." ></i>`, `<i class="fa-brands fa-..." ></i>`) for any UI icons across all Angular templates.
- Never use inline `<svg>` elements for icons.
- Font Awesome Free styles are imported globally via `angular.json`.

